{"id":"n3-027","title":"～せてください","romaji":"〜sete kudasai","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Requesting someone to allow or let you do something (causative request).","longExplanation":"The せてください grammar point is used to request permission or ask someone to allow you to do something. It is a polite way of making a request and can be translated as 'please let me...' or 'please allow me...' in English. It is formed by using the causative form of the verb (Verb-させる) in the て-form, plus ください (e.g. 帰らせる → 帰らせて → 帰らせてください).","formation":"Verb-causative (させ) + て + ください","examples":[{"jp":"もう一度説明させてください。","romaji":"Mou ichido setsumei sasete kudasai.","en":"Please let me explain it once more.","words":[{"surface":"もう一度","vocabId":"2005860","reading":"もういちど"},{"surface":"説明","vocabId":"1386460","reading":"せつめい"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"せ","vocabId":"2147990","reading":"せ","baseForm":"せる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"帰らせてください。","romaji":"Kaerasete kudasai.","en":"Please let me go home.","words":[{"surface":"帰ら","vocabId":"1221270","reading":"かえら","baseForm":"帰る"},{"surface":"せ","vocabId":"2147990","reading":"せ","baseForm":"せる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3]},{"jp":"その本を見せてください。","romaji":"Sono hon o misete kudasai.","en":"Please let me see that book.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本","vocabId":"1522150","reading":"ほん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見せてください","vocabId":"1259210","reading":"みせてください","baseForm":"見せる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"ここで待たせてください。","romaji":"Koko de matasete kudasai.","en":"Please let me wait here.","words":[{"surface":"ここ","vocabId":"1288810","reading":"ここ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"待た","vocabId":"1410590","reading":"また","baseForm":"待つ"},{"surface":"せ","vocabId":"2147990","reading":"せ","baseForm":"せる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]}],"kind":"construction"}